<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,373.08 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,373.08 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at 7,373.08 points, down 39.63 points or 0.54 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.90 billion forints, compared to 5.67 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
